# Raw 47 s Stable Audio returns (~620 MB). Pure intermediate — every take is
# reproducible from the seed/prompt in its JSON sidecar and gen/manifest.json.
approved/
extracted/
gen_raw/
gen/
# Music experiment (generate_music.py / post_music.py) — same deal: raw model
